components.what_we_do:
tools/replay_probe.py and tools/frame_quality_probe.py build FlashCHORD's own RLEnv on CPU (1 world):
- explicit reset to frame f, zero residual action, real soft wrists, VOC 0, as in the evaluation;
- step K times; report the worst object deviation from the reference (cm / °), termination, and per-object height change;
- this gives a per-start-frame cleanliness map.
Plus qa.py ref thresholds and contact_probe / robot_clearance checks. Run by hand: not yet an automatic gate in pipeline_ep.sh.
